.tvcp/contacts.json
*.profile

# AI preview artifacts. The 12 images referenced by ai/*.md and ai/showcase.html
# are tracked intentionally; new throwaway captures should NOT be committed —
# regenerate them or attach them to a GitHub release instead. (Removing the
# already-committed blobs from git *history* would need git-filter-repo + a
# force-push to a protected branch; see ai/previews/README.md.)
ai/previews/*_final.png
ai/previews/*_frame*.png
ai/previews/*_clamped.png
